  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Hei Lou Lan is about to send Pan Ping for the first challenge, Dong Fang Yu Liang instead sends her against Wolf King Chang Shan Yin. Camp talk treats the challenge as a plan against the Wolf King. The same stretch places the fight in the Northern Plains and Imperial Court contest under Hei tribe versus Dong Fang alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        508
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_pan_ping",
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang",
        "char_chang_shan_yin",
        "evt_arc_northern_plains_imperial_court",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "fac_dong_fang_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a lovely body. When the wolf tide hits, her face turns as pale as paper.",
      "chapters": [
        509
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, injured in bed, she covers her lips with a handkerchief and her beautiful brows furrow deeply in pain.",
      "chapters": [
        567
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is Tang tribe’s specially cultivated enslavement path female Gu Master at rank four middle stage, likes foxes, and has exquisite control over them, though she has no notable achievements in history before this challenge. Dong Fang Yu Liang had found her not long before: she is strong with small fox groups and, with her supporting Gu, can match an enslavement path master in that scale of fight, so he uses her to scheme against the Wolf King in public. Fang Yuan, under the Chang Shan Yin name, refuses a limited duel and waves a five hundred thousand wolf tide instead; she holds for a time with a thousand-beast fox round formation, then collapses when Hei tribe’s charge arrives, and Pan Ping captures her for Hei Lou Lan. Tang Fang is her third brother and tries to rush after her until an elder forces him back.",
      "chapters": [
        509
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fox-commander",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_tang_tribe",
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_tang_fang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan later lists Little Fox Commander Tang Miao Ming among his rank four Gu Masters beside Chang Shan Yin, Water Demon Hao Ji Liu, Shadow Sword Expert Bian Si Xuan, and Sole Blade Pan Ping, and classes her with Chang Shan Yin as an enslavement path Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        525
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "under-hei-lou-lan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_hao_ji_liu",
        "char_bian_si_xuan",
        "char_pan_ping"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later army summary still counts her among the rank four experts around Hei Lou Lan.",
      "chapters": [
        527
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "under-hei-lou-lan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Eighty-Eight True Yang Building a planted speaker offers her as a substitute when Fang Yuan is busy, saying her enslavement path attainment is already very close to master realm.",
      "chapters": [
        565
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "under-hei-lou-lan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She later talks with Tang Fang as Tang tribe kin, urging him as tribe leader to use the building to restore the tribe after heavy contest losses.",
      "chapters": [
        567
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "under-hei-lou-lan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later floor defense she is named Fox Commander Tang Miao Ming among the experts present, and with Hei Qi Sheng she orders beast groups in: she controls the fox groups on the ground while he runs the eagles in the sky.",
      "chapters": [
        582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "under-hei-lou-lan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_qi_sheng"
      ]
    }
  ],
